WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:03.030
Helpsters, our goal is to help Heart

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:05.050
prepare to play tee-ball now.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.330
Who's got an idea?

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:07.360
Oh, me, yeah.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.740
If we're playing tee-ball, we need a ball.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:11.960
I have a ball.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:12.460
Oh.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:12.960
Great, OK.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:13.620
So that's done.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.950
And I know how to catch but I do not have a glove.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.880
Well, then we will fix that with job one.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.710
Get a tee-ball glove.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.800
In tee-ball, you have to hit a ball with a bat.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.920
I have a bat but I do not know how to hit.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.350
Oh, then we shall teach you.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:34.890
We certainly shall, and that is job two.

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:38.010
Teach Heart how to hit the tee ball.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.530
OK, OK.

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:45.572
Oh, you see, Heart, yeah, you see that door over there open?

00:00:45.572 --> 00:00:47.280
Yeah, would you mind closing that please?

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.340
I will do this.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:48.840
OK.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:49.830
OK, come to a huddle.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:50.710
Oh, OK.

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:51.210
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.085
What's all this then?

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:54.570
Well, Heart seems a little nervous about playing tee-ball,

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:55.080
am I right?

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:55.955
Yeah, I noticed that.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.810
Yeah, so what I was thinking is maybe

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.150
we should surprise Heart at the game

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:01.950
to show how much we believe in Heart.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:02.770
A surprise job?

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:03.270
Yeah.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:04.810
What a wonderful idea.

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:05.310
Thanks.

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:05.610
Great.

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:07.560
But I'm not going to put it on the board, OK?

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:08.560
Because it's a surprise.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:10.260
Exactly, buddy.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:11.400
OK, break, break.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.520
I closed the door.

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.730
That is fantastic Heart, and guess what?

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:18.650
We have our plan.

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:21.310
We've got the plan, got the plan.

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:22.210
We've figured it out.

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:23.200
We've got the plan.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.330
What happens when we've got the plan?

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:27.220
We give a happy shout just because we can.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.180
Woo-hoo!

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:29.590
I'll go find a place to practice.

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:30.460
Great.

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:33.520
And I'll get to work on the secret job.

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:34.240
Great.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:38.110
And Heart, you and I will go get a glove

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.830
by visiting glove store Glen.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.200
Cody, Heart, wonderful to see you both.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:46.850
What kind of glove can I get for you?

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:48.770
A tee-ball glove.

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:50.120
Mm-hmm.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:51.020
I have several.

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:53.630
Let me show you.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.430
Over here.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:57.530
Oh, hello.

00:01:57.530 --> 00:02:00.680
Which glove is the glove for me?

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.930
Well, let's make a rule to help us choose.

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:06.428
If the glove fits on your hand, then it's the glove for you.

00:02:06.428 --> 00:02:07.220
How about this one?

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.060
No, too small.

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:17.750
Then it is not the glove for you.

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:18.250
Last one.

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:26.450
Oh, it fits!

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:28.640
Get a tee-ball glove, check.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:29.940
Thanks so much Glen!

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:30.580
Thank you.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:32.280
Good-bye Glen.

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:35.090
Heart, I have set up the tee-ball tee just for you.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.670
I do not know what to do now.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.580
Oh, well, why don't we go through the sequence, huh?

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:41.600
Yes, please.

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:43.280
Take it away Scatter.

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:44.510
OK.

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:49.460
First, put both hands on the bat.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:54.320
Next, swing the bat away from the ball.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:58.208
Last, swing the bat towards the ball.

00:02:58.208 --> 00:02:59.450
Mm.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.200
I did not hit it.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.330
Hmm.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:04.580
I wonder if there's something wrong with the sequence.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.110
Well, let's go through it slowly, OK?

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:06.610
OK.

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:09.380
First, put both hands on the bat.

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:11.480
OK, looking good.

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:16.620
Next, swing the bat away from the ball.

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.920
Heart, you're not looking at the ball.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:21.510
After you swing the bat away from the ball--

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.570
Then look at the ball.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:24.410
Mm.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:27.110
Last, swing the bat toward the ball.

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.880
Mm-hmm.

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:30.444
I hit the ball!

00:03:30.444 --> 00:03:33.110
Yeah, you did!

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:36.290
Teach Heart how to hit a tee ball, check.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:38.030
Let's get you to the game.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.293
Hooray!

00:03:39.293 --> 00:03:40.220
Yeah!

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.300
Great news, Toni.

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:42.920
We have your tee-ball player.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.660
Na-na!

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:45.660
It is me.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.640
Great news everybody.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:47.947
We have enough players to play.

00:03:47.947 --> 00:03:48.530
Oh, wonderful.

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:50.480
Yeah, Heart's on the team.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.555
Looks like you're first.

00:03:51.555 --> 00:03:52.055
First?

00:03:52.055 --> 00:03:53.330
Yeah.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.260
Here's your bat.

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:55.250
Thank you.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.090
You got this Heart.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.740
We're going to go find some seats, OK?

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:03.020
Yeah!

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:07.590
Where is Mr. Primm with the secret job?

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:08.280
Right here.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.050
Oh, great.

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:11.654
Hey, Heart?

00:04:11.654 --> 00:04:14.620
Hm?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:18.220
Helpsters heart Heart.

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:21.910
That means that they love me!

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:24.790
Surprise Heart at the game, check.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.380
Thank you, my friends.

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:27.550
We believe in you!

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.410
Remember the sequence!

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:33.890
First, put both hands on the bat.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:37.990
Next, swing the bat away from the ball.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:41.240
Then look at the ball.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.830
Last, swing the bat towards the ball.

00:04:52.735 --> 00:04:53.235
Yeah!

00:04:53.235 --> 00:04:54.720
Hooray!

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:57.195
Run around the bases Heart!

00:04:57.195 --> 00:05:05.115
[CLAPPING]

00:05:05.115 --> 00:05:06.960
You're doing great, Heart.

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.085
Oh, Heart, there's nobody--

00:05:08.085 --> 00:05:09.075
Yes, yes!

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:10.065
Woo!

00:05:10.065 --> 00:05:11.055
Come on, Heart.

00:05:11.055 --> 00:05:12.540
You got this, you got this.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.025
Yes, you're almost home!

00:05:14.025 --> 00:05:16.005
Heart!

00:05:16.005 --> 00:05:17.485
Woo!

00:05:17.485 --> 00:05:17.985
Yes!

00:05:17.985 --> 00:05:18.975
Yes.

00:05:18.975 --> 00:05:19.965
I did it.

00:05:19.965 --> 00:05:21.360
I made a point.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:21.960
Yeah!

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.510
Hooray!

